                <pb facs="0305" n="959" xml:id="pg959"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">indorsed.</hi></head>
                <p>Proceedings of an inquest held on the bodies of Filomeno Rios, Epifaneo Rios,
                    Jorge Rodriguez, José Maria, Leonardo Garza, Vicente Garcia, and Bias Mata,
                    December 6, 1873, at La Chuza, Duval County.</p>
                <closer><signed>JAMES O. LUBY,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Justice of the Peace,
                            Precinct No</hi>. 3, <hi rendition="#italic">Nueces County, Acting
                            Coroner.</hi></signed></closer>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">Filed <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-01-28">January 28, A. D. 1874</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>JOSEPH FITZSIMMONS,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Clerk District Court,
                            Nueces County.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
